ure, fine pebble grain texture, and a high-shine gold metallic clasp. The overall tone is warm and sophisticated, cinematic cinematography, 4K resolution, smooth camera movement.\n\n---\n\n### 【分镜 1 / Shot 1】 *(预计时长 / Length: 3s)*\n**中文提示词：** 中景镜头。主播双手稳稳托举着真皮手提包，面带亲切的微笑看向镜头，身体轻微左右晃动展示包包的整体轮廓。\n主播说：“家人们看这款真皮手提包，颜色高级质感满满！”\n**English Prompt:** Medium shot. The host holds the leather handbag steadily with both hands, looking at the camera with a friendly smile, slightly swaying her body to show the overall silhouette of the bag. She says in Chinese: “家人们看这款真皮手提包，颜色高级质感满满！”\n\n### 【分镜 2 / Shot 2】 *(预计时长 / Length: 3s)*\n**中文提示词：** 极写特写镜头。镜头平滑推近包包表面，展示清晰的荔枝皮纹理和闪耀的金色锁扣，主播纤细的手指轻轻抚摸皮革边缘。\n主播说：“纯正头层牛皮，荔枝纹理非常细腻，五金超闪亮。”\n**English Prompt:** Extreme close-up shot. The camera smoothly zooms in on the bag's surface, showcasing the clear pebble grain texture and the shining gold clasp. The host's slender fingers gently stroke the edge of the leather. She says in Chinese: “纯正头层牛皮，荔枝纹理非常细腻，五金超闪亮。”\n\n### 【分镜 3 / Shot 3】 *(预计时长 / Length: 3s)*\n**中文提示词：** 中景。主播将包包优雅地挽在手臂弯处，侧身展示包包的立体侧影和轻盈感，她眼神自信，展现出精英通勤风格。\n主播说：“容量大又轻便，通勤背它，瞬间提升气质和气场。”\n**English Prompt:** Medium shot. The host elegantly carries the bag in the crook of her arm, turning slightly to show its three-dimensional profile and lightness. Her eyes are confident, embodying an elite commuting style. She says in Chinese: “容量大又轻便，通勤背它，瞬间提升气质和气场。”\n\n### 【分镜 4 / Shot 4】 *(预计时长 / Length: 3s)*\n**中文提示词：** 中景。主播轻按金色锁扣演示开合，随后对着镜头做出推荐的手势，表情热情，引导观众下单。\n主播说：“现货只有最后十个了，喜欢的姐妹赶紧左下角带走！”\n**English Prompt:** Medium shot. The host lightly presses the gold clasp to demonstrate opening and closing, then makes a recommending gesture towards the camera with an enthusiastic expression, guiding the audience to order. She says in Chinese: “现货只有最后十个了，喜欢的姐妹赶紧左下角带走！”"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "anything", "link": 61, "label": "输入任何", "type": "*", "localized_name": "anything"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy showAnything", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#3f515